                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Learned of this game through Oneyplays and they got me to buy the game. Game is honestly way easier than they made it out to be but that sounds about right for how they play games haha. The platforming is satisfying, the new abilities are all game changers, the music is REALLY good, and the dialogue is very charming and well written, I liked watching Chris learn to believe in himself. Only sad thing is the game is very short even when you 100% it. Overall, I had a great albeit short time with this game and I recommend it.",
